
Package: finalproject
Title: Statistical Analysis of Public Health Data
Version: 0.0.2
Authors@R:
    person(given = "Nicole",
           family = "Qin",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "nicoleqin@hsph.harvard.edu")
Description: This package contains statistical analyses of publicly
    available public health datasets for the BST260 final project.
    The project explores patterns and associations in health-related
    outcomes using descriptive statistics, visualization, and
    statistical models. It also discusses uncertainty, methodological
    limitations, and the interpretation of scientific findings.
Depends: R (>= 4.5.0)
Imports: stats, graphics, utils
Suggests: knitr, testthat, rmarkdown, pkgdown
License: Artistic-2.0
VignetteBuilder: quarto
Encoding: UTF-8
URL: https://github.com/ccc070503/finalproject
